WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.375
in it runs once, then update and draw run 60 times a second.

2
00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:09.175
in it runs once, when the game starts: x begins at the left.

3
00:00:10.076 --> 00:00:14.526
update runs 60 times a second: it moves x a little each time.

4
00:00:15.376 --> 00:00:19.626
draw runs after each update: clear the screen, then draw the dot.

5
00:00:22.488 --> 00:00:27.263
Nobody calls these functions in the code: the engine does, over and over.
